        ],
        "Description": "The SUNSEEKER S4 is a wireless robot lawn mower designed for lawns up to 0.25 acre, or approximately 10,750 sq. ft. A 360° 3D LiDAR system works with Vision AI and a 10 TOPS AI chip to build a detailed 3D lawn map, plan systematic mowing paths and respond to static and moving obstacles. Because navigation does not depend on RTK satellite positioning, S4 is well suited to yards with tree cover, tall eaves, narrow passages and other areas where satellite signals may be limited. S4 handles slopes up to 22° (about 40% grade) and uses a 7 in. cutting system with 3 height settings from 1.6 to 3.2 in. A 20V 4Ah battery provides up to 90 minutes of runtime and recharges in about 1.5 hours. Use the app to create virtual boundaries, set no-go areas and manage multiple zones. Quiet 60 dB(A) operation, IPX6/IP67 protection, rain and lift sensors support everyday use. Backed by 2 years of manufacturer support.",
